WEBVTT

00:00:14.186 --> 00:00:15.437
[sighs]

00:00:17.898 --> 00:00:20.651
Actually, Zee, it was all my fault.
小Z 其实当初都是我的错

00:00:21.151 --> 00:00:24.029
You're right.
We lost the team because of me.
你说得对 我们失去了队友 这都怪我

00:00:24.113 --> 00:00:26.865
No, it was because of me.
不 都怪我

00:00:26.949 --> 00:00:29.618
No, I insist I take the blame.
不 我坚持由我来承担过错

00:00:30.369 --> 00:00:32.830
Well, I insist you return the blame
and give it to me.
我坚持你把过错还给我

00:00:32.913 --> 00:00:36.458
Look, it wasn't you. It wasn't me.
听着 不是你的错 是我的错

00:00:38.043 --> 00:00:39.461
-It was us.
-It was us.
-是我们的错
-是我们的错

00:00:39.962 --> 00:00:42.923
If we really want harmony
in the Lost World,
如果我们真想在失落的世界里和睦共处

00:00:43.007 --> 00:00:45.718
it has to start with you and me
working together.
那就得从你我开始 一起努力

00:00:48.304 --> 00:00:51.473
[muffled laughing]

00:00:55.644 --> 00:00:57.646
Get Mama and the possums to safety.
把妈妈和负鼠们带到安全的地方去

00:01:05.529 --> 00:01:06.864
Wha-- What's he doing?
他在做什么？

00:01:06.947 --> 00:01:08.449
Giving us time to escape.
帮我们争取脱身的时间

00:01:09.491 --> 00:01:11.535
Okay, brainiac.
好了 大头怪

00:01:12.036 --> 00:01:13.245
It's me you want.
你想要的是我

00:01:13.746 --> 00:01:15.623
You got me.
你如愿以偿了

00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:19.210
I win! [laughs]
我赢了

00:01:21.378 --> 00:01:23.339
[Orson] Take him to the watering hole.
把他带到饮水坑去

00:01:23.422 --> 00:01:27.384
There, I'll make an example of him
in front of all the other mammals.
我要当着其他哺乳动物的面 杀一儆百

00:01:27.468 --> 00:01:29.595
Whoa. [laughs]

00:01:29.678 --> 00:01:31.430
Revenge is mine.
报仇雪恨的时候到了

00:01:32.514 --> 00:01:34.725
Hey, great idea alert.
叮咚 想出一个好主意

00:01:35.226 --> 00:01:38.103
Guess who had it? Me. Of course.
是谁想出来的 当然是我 那还用说

00:01:48.656 --> 00:01:50.783
[roaring]

00:01:50.866 --> 00:01:52.660
[Zee] Whoa, whoa, whoa. Easy now.
悠着点

00:01:52.743 --> 00:01:55.120
Just get your strength back, Mama T.
你得先恢复体力 霸王龙妈妈

00:01:55.204 --> 00:01:58.999
Orson's taking Buck back
to the watering hole. Meet us there.
奥森把巴克带去饮水坑了
去那里跟我们碰头

00:02:12.972 --> 00:02:15.975
-[rumbling]
-[snarling]

00:02:28.779 --> 00:02:30.114
[snarling]

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:22.625
[sighs] This is all our fault, Eddie.
这都怪我们 埃迪

00:03:23.125 --> 00:03:25.794
Buck said it was
a bad time for us to visit.
巴克之前说过 我们来得不是时候

00:03:25.878 --> 00:03:28.255
Yeah, if he didn't have to
look out for us,
对 要不是为了照顾我们

00:03:28.339 --> 00:03:30.049
maybe this never would have happened.
他或许就不会出事了

00:03:30.132 --> 00:03:32.092
I wish we could've done something
to help him.
我真希望我们能为他做些什么

00:03:32.676 --> 00:03:34.136
-Like what?
-I don't know.
-做什么呢
-不知道

00:03:34.678 --> 00:03:37.932
Something cool,
like master the power of lightning.
做些很酷的事 比如操控闪电的力量

00:03:38.015 --> 00:03:40.851
Whoa! How awesome would that be?
那该多厉害呀

00:03:40.935 --> 00:03:43.729
Crash and Eddie: Lightning Masters!
克拉什和埃迪 闪电操控者

00:03:43.812 --> 00:03:48.192
Yeah, we'd be all zap this and zap that.
And zap the first thing again.
对啊 我们就能电这个
电那个 再电头一个

00:03:49.151 --> 00:03:50.611
Ah, face it, bro.
面对现实吧 哥们 我们永远都成不了
闪电操控者 也没法在世上留名

00:03:50.694 --> 00:03:54.073
We're never gonna be lightning masters,
or make our mark.
面对现实吧 哥们 我们永远都成不了
闪电操控者 也没法在世上留名

00:03:54.156 --> 00:03:55.950
Or pretty much do anything.
我们几乎什么事都做不成

00:03:56.575 --> 00:03:58.369
Ellie was right about us.
埃丽说得对

00:03:58.452 --> 00:04:00.496
We're not ready to be on our own.
我们还没准备好独当一面

00:04:01.163 --> 00:04:02.331
[both scream]

00:04:02.873 --> 00:04:05.960
Is this what Buck would do? Give up? Sulk?
巴克会这么做吗 半途而废 闷闷不乐？

00:04:06.043 --> 00:04:07.795
But we let him down.
但我们辜负了他

00:04:07.878 --> 00:04:11.006
Which means it's time to buck up.
所以才该打起精神来呀

00:04:11.090 --> 00:04:13.175
You mean rush in without thinking?
你是说不假思索向前冲吗

00:04:13.259 --> 00:04:14.552
[chuckles]

00:04:14.635 --> 00:04:16.470
Yeah, well, he would do that.
那的确是他的作风

00:04:16.554 --> 00:04:20.140
I, however, wouldn't have left
without a plan to rescue him.
然而 我却要有了营救计划 才会有所行动

00:04:20.683 --> 00:04:22.476
But I'm gonna need your help.
但我需要你们的帮助

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:24.520
We could if we had a superpower.
我们要是有超能力就能帮上忙了

00:04:25.771 --> 00:04:27.565
Remember what Buck taught you.
别忘了巴克是怎么教你们的

00:04:27.648 --> 00:04:30.150
It's not powers that make you a superhero.
成就超级英雄的不是超能力

00:04:31.151 --> 00:04:33.028
It's courage.
是勇气

00:04:33.112 --> 00:04:34.738
And resourcefulness.
还有智慧

00:04:36.615 --> 00:04:38.576
Maybe that's our problem, Crash.
或许这就是我们的问题 克拉什

00:04:38.659 --> 00:04:41.745
Whenever we're in trouble,
all we do is play dead.
每次遇到困难 我们只知道装死

00:04:41.829 --> 00:04:43.497
Well, it is our go-to move.
这是我们必用的把戏

00:04:43.581 --> 00:04:46.375
Yeah, but it's kinda
the opposite of courage.
对 但这和勇气似乎刚好相反

00:04:46.959 --> 00:04:48.419
Yeah, I see that.
的确是

00:04:48.919 --> 00:04:51.088
But where can we get courage?
但我们要怎么获得勇气呢

00:04:51.171 --> 00:04:52.673
You already have it…
你们已经有了

00:04:53.674 --> 00:04:54.758
right here.
就在这里

00:04:55.259 --> 00:04:56.844
In our chest fur?
在我们的胸毛里？

00:04:57.511 --> 00:04:59.805
She means our spleens.
她指的是我们的脾脏

00:04:59.889 --> 00:05:01.056
Yeah!
对哦

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:05.603
If we can harness the power
of our spleens, we can master lightning!
如果我们能驾驭脾脏的力量
我们就能控制闪电

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:07.438
[groans]

00:05:10.941 --> 00:05:12.610
We're here on Raptor River.
我们现在在猛龙河上

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:15.779
[Zee] Orson's got Buck
here at the watering hole.
奥森把巴克囚禁在饮水坑这里

00:05:15.863 --> 00:05:17.656
We'll launch a surprise attack.
我们要发动一场突袭

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:20.534
Like a surprise party with weapons.
[squeals]
就像带武器的惊喜派对

00:05:21.327 --> 00:05:24.788
Mmm… I dunno, Zee,
or whatever your real name is.
我不确定 小Z 也不知这是不是你的真名

00:05:24.872 --> 00:05:28.209
The three of us
against Orson's whole army?
就我们三个去对抗奥森的大军？

00:05:28.292 --> 00:05:29.293
Hey!

00:05:29.376 --> 00:05:31.587
You would be surprised
what we're capable of.
我们的能力会让你们大吃一惊的

00:05:32.254 --> 00:05:34.924
I just wish we knew
how Orson controls the raptors.
要是我们能知道
奥森是怎么控制猛龙的 那就好了

00:05:35.007 --> 00:05:38.677
Maybe he gives them treats.
I know I'd do anything for a marshmallow.
或许他给他们发好吃的
我知道我为了棉花糖什么都肯做

00:05:38.761 --> 00:05:40.137
Would you marry a frog?
连娶一只青蛙都肯？

00:05:40.221 --> 00:05:42.181
-What kind of frog?
-Focus, guys.
-哪种青蛙？
-别跑题 两位

00:05:42.264 --> 00:05:44.016
It's time to train for the mission.
现在该进行特训了

